title: explain
---
Sophia: She speaks first, loudly, to those who trust her. I won't win that argument by staying. But I want you to know — I chose to leave. For me. Not because of her. That distinction matters.
-> Will I see you again?
    <<jump maybe>>
-> I understand.
    <<jump letter>>
